# Semantic Tailwind colors

Define brand colors only in `src/styles/theme.css` (`@theme`).

## Use

```html
<button class="bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary-hover">Save</button>
<p class="text-muted">Hint</p>
<div class="border-border bg-surface">Card</div>
```

## Avoid

```html
<button class="bg-slate-900">Save</button>
<button class="bg-blue-600">Save</button>
<span class="text-red-600">Error</span>
```

## Tokens

`primary`, `secondary`, `accent`, `success`, `warning`, `danger`, `info`,
`background`, `surface`, `border`, `foreground`, `muted`
